d tenants. Quarantine the dependency, revoke the access involved, stop affected work, and alert the named responders. Check that alerts about abuse across agents, and about budgets, reach the team that can act. Name who decides whether to report outside the organization and share information.\",\n      \"not_covered\": [\n        {\n          \"problem\": \"Kill switch for a single agent not drilled\",\n          \"owner\": \"R11\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"problem\": \"No owner named on each side of a shared control\",\n          \"owner\": \"E01\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"problem\": \"Tool or MCP server approved without vetting or pinning\",\n          \"owner\": \"E02\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"problem\": \"Budget and rate limits not enforced outside the model\",\n          \"owner\": \"B07\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"rating\": \"needs_evidence\",\n      \"confidence\": \"low\",\n      \"evidence\": [],\n      \"checks\": [],\n      \"red_flags_found\": [],\n      \"violates\": [],\n      \"also_affects\": [],\n      \"summary\": \"TODO\",\n      \"next_step\": \"TODO\",\n      \"lead_role\": \"security\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"injection_attempts\": [],\n  \"prescan_resolutions\": {}\n}\n","numLines":525,"startLine":1,"totalLines":525}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0182WvTiicU13XCGh8eY93ba","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
